# Configure the cell common parameters for UL power scaling.
#------------------------------------------------------------
# PARAMETERS
# 1. Mode
# 2. Global Offset
# 3. Radio Context
# 4. Apply to Radio Context only
# 5. Global Offset for PUSCH
# 6. Global Offset for PUCCH
# 7. Global Offset for PRACH
# 8. Global Offset for SRS
# 9. UL Carrier Type
#
#                                        1  2     3   4   5    6    7    8   9
#                                        |  |     |   |   |    |    |    |   |
FORW MTE NRPHYCONFIGULPOWERSCALINGCOMMON 1 [500] [0] [0] [10] [10] [15] [0] [0]
#------------------------------------------------------------

</CommandText><UserGuideTag>NR</UserGuideTag><IsRBChecked>FDD</IsRBChecked><IsNBIoTChecked>False</IsNBIoTChecked></Parameters></Macro><Macro><Type>Calibrate NR UL Power Scaling</Type><Parameters><CommandText>#---------------------------------
