#---------------------------------
# PARAMETERS
# 1. Radio Context
# 2. Signalled SSB Reference Signal Power
# 3. Delta UL DL Physical Attenuation
#
#                                      1   2  3
#                                      |   |  |
FORW MTE NRPHYCALIBRATEULPOWERSCALING [0] [] [0] []
#---------------------------------

